# When Wills Collide (WotG 46) not current (Time Slips Away current): the Ornate Door (_521) sends only the release (no
# script answers it in the Walk of Echoes); with a Status 2 var the rezone plays no zone-in event.
lists GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrigger GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrade GraubergS/onEventFinish/29 GraubergS/onEventFinish/42 WalkOfEchoes/_521/onTrigger WalkOfEchoes/onZoneIn/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventUpdate/2 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/1 WalkOfEchoes/onEventFinish/2
char zone=WalkOfEchoes pos=-700.042,0.4,-441.301 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg TimeSlipsAway current
login
trigger _521
finish-if-event
charvar Mission[5][45]Status 2
rezone
